Package: a5view
Title: Interactive Map Viewer for A5 Geospatial Cells
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hugh", "Graham", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "hugh@belian.earth"),
    person("belian.earth", role = "cph")
    )
Description: An 'htmlwidgets' viewer that renders 'A5' geospatial index
    cells on an interactive map using 'deck.gl' over a 'MapLibre' basemap
    ('OpenFreeMap' vector tiles, no API key). Supports colour mapping with a
    legend, palette selection, basemap switching, opacity control, hover
    tooltips, cell borders, a globe projection and precomputed
    level-of-detail pyramids for large datasets.
